%% Sequence: the switch, one stop, one reading, and one mark.
%% The Stop hook never awaits the reading. Names follow contracts.md.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Person as Engineer
    participant CC as Claude Code session
    participant Mod as Hooks module
    participant CLI as priority-dev CLI
    participant LLM as Mercury model service
    participant Store as $.store
    participant Pane as Priority pane

    Person->>CC: /priority-on
    CC->>Mod: command.run
    Mod->>Mod: Switch on in $.state
    Mod->>Pane: Opens the pane, title Priority reader

    CC->>Mod: classic.Stop, main loop only
    Mod->>Mod: Puts the stop in the queue
    Mod-->>CC: next(e) at once, no block, no context

    Mod->>CLI: $.process.run priority digest, timeoutMs
    CLI->>LLM: Digest call
    LLM-->>CLI: Digest
    CLI-->>Mod: Exit 0, digest saved in reports/logs/live
    Mod->>CLI: $.process.run priority interpret --program D1 --digest current
    CLI->>LLM: Reading call, brief with CURRENT RUN

    opt A stop comes while the reading runs
        CC->>Mod: classic.Stop
        Mod->>Mod: Replaces the one waiting stop
        Mod-->>CC: next(e) at once
    end

    LLM-->>CLI: Reading
    CLI-->>Mod: JSON with status, priority, steps, abstain

    Mod->>Store: Adds the reading to readings:session id
    Store-->>Pane: ui.render redraws, newest card first
    Note over Mod: The module then starts the waiting stop, if one waits

    Person->>Pane: Marks right, wrong, or a note
    Pane->>Store: Writes marks:session id, by reading number
    Note over Mod,Pane: A failed command stores state failed with its error, and the card shows it

    Person->>Pane: Selects steps on the newest card, reads the draft
    alt Send
        Person->>Pane: Presses Send
        Pane->>CC: $.prompt.submit, text, asUser true
        CC->>CC: New user turn when idle, its stop gets a new reading
    else Edit
        Person->>Pane: Presses Edit
        Pane->>CC: $.prompt.fill, the draft in the prompt box
        Person->>CC: Edits and presses Enter
    end
    Pane->>Store: Writes sent on the mark, steps and text
